Every recorded command allocated its storage through the queue's ring allocator (out-of-line calls,
std::queue access). Commands are now bumped inline from a 64 KB span the chunk reserves there and drops
on commit/reset. App thread submit time: -5% in the base bench, -12% with state switching per draw.

